    "name": "#2 Juicing Carrots",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Claimed to be the perfect health food. It is crunchy, tasty, and highly nutritious. Carrots are a particularly good source of beta carotene, fiber, vitamin K1, potassium, and antioxidants. Carrots a verastile- add them to soups, stews, salads, casseroles, the possibilities are endless.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">What Are #2 Carrots?</span></p><ul class=\"lexical-text-editor--list-ul\"><li value=\"1\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Grade definition:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Carrots that do not meet the cosmetic standards for regular grocery store display (Grade #1).</span></li><li value=\"2\"><b><strong class=\"lexical-text-editor--bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Appearance:</strong></b><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"> They may be crooked, split, cracked, undersized, oversized, or slightly scarred, but they are fresh and healthy.</span></li></ul>",
